{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50309","headline":"晚秋登城之作 一 · 佚名","name":"晚秋登城之作 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤城落日一登临，感激戎庭万里心。\n乡国云山遮不见，风光惨澹益愁深。\n漂流空叹东溪水，倏忽仍嗟西岭阴。\n留滞只今寒暑变，谁怜客子独悲吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50309.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50309","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}